1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,320
[Characters, places and incidents
in this production]

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,640
[are entirely fictitious.]

3
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,960
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

4
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,980
<i>How am I supposed to think</i>

5
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:03,185
<i>about my fiancé watching over
a security guard like this?</i>

6
00:01:03,185 --> 00:01:05,720
<i>Yai and I got engaged
while we were in the US.</i>

7
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:09,705
<i>If you're not too busy, come see me at home.</i>

8
00:01:09,705 --> 00:01:12,837
<i>This is Dao's hair. Use this to test her DNA.</i>

9
00:01:13,734 --> 00:01:15,640
<i>The DNA test report is here.</i>

10
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,000
[The probability of paternity is 99.99%]

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,880
<i>Thank you, Uncle Yai. I'm going now. Goodbye.</i>

12
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,423
<i>- Where's Daran?
- She resigned, sir.</i>

13
00:01:24,424 --> 00:01:26,381
<i>I know our child is alive.</i>

14
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,760
Stop running.

15
00:01:29,595 --> 00:01:30,960
We have to talk.

16
00:01:34,646 --> 00:01:36,675
These are Dao's and my DNA test results.

17
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,483
Dao is my daughter.

18
00:01:51,291 --> 00:01:52,840
The test confirmed it.

19
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,489
But I don't know whose test this is.

20
00:01:55,587 --> 00:01:57,040
How did you get Dao's DNA?

21
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,266
How I got it doesn't matter,

22
00:01:59,266 --> 00:02:00,894
but Dao is my daughter.

23
00:02:04,928 --> 00:02:06,630
Or do you want me to ask Duean?

24
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:07,920
Don't.

25
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,636
Don't go to my house. I beg you.

26
00:02:13,247 --> 00:02:15,222
We need to come to an agreement.

27
00:02:23,978 --> 00:02:25,753
Today I went to a bookstore,

28
00:02:25,753 --> 00:02:28,377
and carrying all those books
made me muscular.

29
00:02:29,696 --> 00:02:32,400
Oh, you... you've got something on your lips.

30
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,780
Come, let me wipe it for you.

31
00:02:36,509 --> 00:02:39,680
Thank you. So this is what these taste like.

32
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,400
You've never had these?

33
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,320
No, they're expensive.

34
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,160
I usually get the five-baht ones,

35
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:47,641
or ten baht at most.

36
00:02:47,641 --> 00:02:50,840
Would you like some more?
I bought several of these.

37
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,679
I can have more?

38
00:02:52,679 --> 00:02:55,930
Of course. You can eat as much as you want.

39
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:59,320
You won't deduct it from my pay, right?

40
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:01,134
I won't.

41
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:04,880
Thank you. Then I want another one.

42
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,355
I'll go get it for you.

43
00:03:06,355 --> 00:03:09,720
If I don't take good care of you,
you might not come visit me tomorrow.

44
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,750
You're so kind, Madam.

45
00:03:18,721 --> 00:03:22,800
Can you just forget it?
Forget I was ever pregnant.

46
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,160
Dao is Dueanchan's daughter
and my younger sister.

47
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,800
Nothing will change.

48
00:03:28,356 --> 00:03:29,972
Don't try to change it.

49
00:03:30,649 --> 00:03:31,808
I don't understand.

50
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,355
Why did you tell me our child was gone?

51
00:03:34,355 --> 00:03:35,918
If you knew she was still alive,

52
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:39,000
you'd find a reason to stay with me.

53
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,293
Why did you want me to leave so badly?

54
00:03:42,507 --> 00:03:44,004
I was tired of you.

55
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,452
Really?

56
00:03:47,963 --> 00:03:49,785
Is that really all?

57
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,000
It's simple.

58
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,977
I didn't get an abortion
because I feared sinning.

59
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,856
And I thought after I gave birth,
I could start anew.

60
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,621
Just like you asked me before,

61
00:04:03,340 --> 00:04:05,371
about why I've only gotten this far.

62
00:04:06,113 --> 00:04:08,670
I tried to find a rich partner.

63
00:04:08,670 --> 00:04:10,896
I even lied to everyone that

64
00:04:10,896 --> 00:04:12,720
Dao is my sister.

65
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,955
I tried to act single,

66
00:04:13,955 --> 00:04:16,733
but none of the rich men
took any interest in me.

67
00:04:16,733 --> 00:04:18,442
You don't have to say more.

68
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:23,240
Or would you like to flirt with me again?

69
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,720
That's not a bad idea,

70
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,955
since we already know each other so well.

71
00:04:26,955 --> 00:04:28,577
We wouldn't have to start from scratch,

72
00:04:29,207 --> 00:04:31,270
so my daughter and I could have an easier life.

73
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,951
Enough.

74
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,888
Stop saying things to make me hate you.

75
00:04:54,239 --> 00:04:55,778
I love you.

76
00:04:58,586 --> 00:05:00,801
Can we start over?

77
00:05:09,106 --> 00:05:10,465
Let go.

78
00:05:13,442 --> 00:05:15,957
Let go of me. Please.

79
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:36,808
The girl named Daran...

80
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,028
is just your ideal lover,

81
00:05:43,090 --> 00:05:44,817
but in reality...

82
00:05:45,407 --> 00:05:48,507
she's just someone who had to
make ends meet every day.

83
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:54,679
She had to take responsibility
for her reckless choices.

84
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,504
I'm not the same as I used to be.

85
00:06:03,143 --> 00:06:04,887
Don't bother helping us.

86
00:06:09,964 --> 00:06:13,520
And don't tell Dao that you're her father.

87
00:06:15,246 --> 00:06:16,590
I feel bad for her

88
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,455
if she found out...

89
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:25,151
that her sister is actually her mother.

90
00:06:31,777 --> 00:06:34,314
I want to protect her feelings.

91
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:40,377
She'd never be okay with it
if she found out...

92
00:06:40,377 --> 00:06:43,555
she was born to irresponsible parents.

93
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:44,160
<i>♪ While your smile is so bright,
inside you're wounded ♪</i>

94
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:50,520
<i>♪ You've been struggling,
but you never stopped to rest ♪</i>

95
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:53,720
<i>♪ You don't always have to be strong ♪</i>

96
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:57,120
<i>♪ If you're tired, just put it down,
down, down, down ♪</i>

97
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:03,060
<i>♪ You don't have to carry every heavy burden ♪</i>

98
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:06,120
<i>♪ If you're lost in a long night ♪</i>

99
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:11,280
<i>♪ I'll bring you home,
hold onto my hand tight ♪</i>

100
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:14,500
<i>♪ I'll always stay right by your side ♪</i>

101
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:17,760
<i>♪ Until you see clear skies ♪</i>

102
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:20,880
<i>♪ I'll never leave your side ♪</i>

103
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:24,120
<i>♪ As long as you still have your pride ♪</i>

104
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:30,480
<i>♪ Whenever you feel tired,
just turn to look at me ♪</i>

105
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:33,920
<i>♪ Dedicating my life to you ♪</i>

106
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:39,740
<i>♪ And protecting you with my heart ♪</i>

107
00:08:48,082 --> 00:08:49,720
Uncle Yai!

108
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,123
Are you tired from work?

109
00:09:11,628 --> 00:09:13,500
Are you visiting Grandma Namthip?

110
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,256
Yes, I'm about to leave now.

111
00:09:17,694 --> 00:09:18,920
I'll drive her home.

112
00:09:20,111 --> 00:09:21,133
Let's go.

113
00:09:30,394 --> 00:09:34,055
This is so expensive, I rarely get to eat it.

114
00:09:34,055 --> 00:09:38,390
Even when I behave really well,
Ran still won't buy it for me.

115
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:41,250
Uncle and Madam are so kind!

116
00:09:42,053 --> 00:09:45,624
If there's anything you want to eat,
just tell me. I'll buy it for you.

117
00:09:48,029 --> 00:09:49,680
All this time,

118
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:52,200
Ran has been so worn out, right?

119
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,720
Yeah, she doesn't even sleep.

120
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:57,475
Don't make her work so hard, Uncle.

121
00:09:59,231 --> 00:10:00,810
I'm sorry.

122
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:05,400
By the way, why are you asking so much
about Ran today?

123
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:08,217
Don't tell me you're trying to flirt with her?

124
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:13,334
If I'm going to flirt with her,
will you let me?

125
00:10:14,014 --> 00:10:18,154
Yes, but it depends on
whether Ran likes you back or not.

126
00:10:18,154 --> 00:10:21,756
My advice for you is to stop acting so aloof,

127
00:10:21,756 --> 00:10:25,029
and maybe Ran will fall for you.

128
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,808
I'll try.

129
00:10:41,777 --> 00:10:43,280
Hey.

130
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:46,155
Don't tell Ran and your mother
I drove you home.

131
00:10:46,155 --> 00:10:48,120
I promise.

132
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,933
And I'm not going to tell her
that you want to flirt with Ran.

133
00:10:52,933 --> 00:10:54,200
Good luck.

134
00:10:57,304 --> 00:10:58,524
Goodbye.

135
00:11:55,853 --> 00:11:57,360
Hey, you.

136
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,440
Yes?

137
00:11:59,207 --> 00:12:01,560
You're still coming here?

138
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:03,449
Aren't you being a little too bold?

139
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:06,320
Why are you saying that to me, old lady?

140
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:09,000
Watch your mouth. Don't call me "old lady."

141
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,380
You're Uncle's mother,
so I have to call you "old lady."

142
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,733
Isn't that right?

143
00:12:13,733 --> 00:12:16,585
I'm not going to insult Uncle Yai's mother.

144
00:12:16,585 --> 00:12:18,533
Why would you have to insult me?

145
00:12:18,533 --> 00:12:20,040
You insolent brat.

146
00:12:21,164 --> 00:12:23,125
How did you know Yai?

147
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,492
[Miss Daranee Kaewkaruna]
[Grade 9, No. 20]

148
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,742
Kaewkaruna...

149
00:12:32,935 --> 00:12:34,679
What are you to Daran?

150
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,200
I'm her younger sister.

151
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,840
Younger sister?

152
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,730
Why are you here then?

153
00:12:40,730 --> 00:12:42,091
Why can't I?

154
00:12:42,091 --> 00:12:44,760
Madam Namthip asked me to read a book to her.

155
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,577
Oh, pretty bold?

156
00:12:47,577 --> 00:12:50,840
You're just as shameless as your sister.
You're both exactly alike!

157
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:53,800
What do you mean?
What does Ran have to do with this?

158
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,200
Why wouldn't she?

159
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:59,080
Your sister is a rotten woman,
trying to seduce my son.

160
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:01,505
That's why I had to drive her off.

161
00:13:01,505 --> 00:13:04,240
No, Ran isn't like that!

162
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,920
Really?

163
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:08,276
Your sister is a shameless, loose woman

164
00:13:08,276 --> 00:13:09,720
who let herself get pregnant.

165
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:15,066
I don't even know who got her pregnant,
but she tried to pin it on my son.

166
00:13:15,066 --> 00:13:16,920
I won't allow that!

167
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:19,255
You're lying! Ran was never pregnant!

168
00:13:19,255 --> 00:13:20,640
I'm not lying!

169
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:23,666
She slept around until she got pregnant
and had an abortion.

170
00:13:23,666 --> 00:13:25,972
I know that better than anyone!

171
00:13:25,972 --> 00:13:29,002
Stop talking about Ran like that!
She isn't like that!

172
00:13:29,002 --> 00:13:33,120
If you're still talking like that,
I'll split your head!

173
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:35,560
You brat! Come on, then.

174
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:39,437
I'll smash your face in too.
Well? Bring it on, come on!

175
00:13:39,437 --> 00:13:42,288
What's all this noise? Huh?

176
00:13:42,982 --> 00:13:44,787
What are you arguing about?

177
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:52,080
Well? Where did Dao go?

178
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,880
- Where did she go?
- That shameless girl?

179
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,943
I drove her away.

180
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,385
Mom,

181
00:14:02,385 --> 00:14:05,585
why did you let her come here and
seduce Lek in our own house?

182
00:14:05,585 --> 00:14:10,120
What are you talking about?
I asked her to read a book to me.

183
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,093
Then why does it have to be her?

184
00:14:12,093 --> 00:14:16,960
What if she grows up and seduces Lek,
just like her sister did to Yai?

185
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:21,810
Can't you think of anything sensible?

186
00:14:22,461 --> 00:14:24,594
Then how am I supposed to think about this?

187
00:14:25,207 --> 00:14:27,851
I'm just trying to protect my family,

188
00:14:28,839 --> 00:14:31,889
but you've never seen me in a positive light.

189
00:14:49,644 --> 00:14:51,360
It's not true.

190
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:53,377
Ran isn't like that.

191
00:14:53,377 --> 00:14:54,688
No way.

192
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,915
[Sam's little Star]
<i>Uncle Yai, where are you?</i>

193
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:15,126
<i>Uncle Yai. Uncle Yai. Uncle Yai.</i>

194
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:26,760
[Madam Namthip]

195
00:15:32,681 --> 00:15:34,040
Welcome back.

196
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:36,640
Did you have fun eating ice cream
with your friends?

197
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:01,640
[Sam's little Star:
Uncle Yai. Uncle Yai. Uncle Yai.]

198
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:18,056
[Uncle Yai]
<i>What is it, Dao? I just saw your messages.</i>

199
00:16:20,680 --> 00:16:22,275
[Sam's little Star]
<i>It's nothing.</i>

200
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,600
[Thai fun is NOW]

201
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,927
<i>Dao, what is it?</i>

202
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,989
<i>Has Ran gotten pregnant before?</i>

203
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,597
<i>Dao!</i>

204
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,474
Why are you blocking the TV?

205
00:17:11,487 --> 00:17:13,049
It's nothing.

206
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,720
Whoa.

207
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:32,910
Did you do all of this yourself?

208
00:17:32,910 --> 00:17:34,040
Yeah.

209
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:37,044
But the quality controller is Mom.

210
00:17:38,155 --> 00:17:39,480
Mom...

211
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,025
Didn't I tell you to stay still?

212
00:17:41,025 --> 00:17:43,760
You too. Didn't I tell you
Mom shouldn't overexert herself?

213
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,840
I'm just sitting here giving orders.

214
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:49,040
Danai's the one doing all the work.

215
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:52,997
I don't think this is going to put
too much strain on my heart.

216
00:17:52,997 --> 00:17:55,465
Yeah, you're exaggerating.

217
00:17:55,465 --> 00:17:58,030
We should let Mom talk and move around,

218
00:17:58,030 --> 00:17:59,520
or she'll get brain atrophy.

219
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:04,000
If she gets Alzheimer's too,
she definitely won't have to do anything.

220
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Hey, what are you saying?

221
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:12,244
Mom, where's Dao?

222
00:18:12,244 --> 00:18:15,688
She's upstairs. She's been acting strange
ever since she came back.

223
00:18:39,866 --> 00:18:42,887
Oh? What are you doing?

224
00:18:44,527 --> 00:18:47,090
Do you like to look at baby pictures?

225
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:01,525
How old were you
when you graduated from high school?

226
00:19:03,091 --> 00:19:04,556
I was 18.

227
00:19:04,556 --> 00:19:05,924
Why?

228
00:19:06,595 --> 00:19:08,768
Nothing, just curious.

229
00:19:09,587 --> 00:19:11,760
I'll get back to studying.

230
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:22,480
Dao, come eat dinner.

231
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:25,200
No, I'm on a diet.

232
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:28,433
You should eat a lot when you're studying.

233
00:19:28,433 --> 00:19:31,200
I want to study. Get out.
You're disrupting my focus.

234
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,877
Close the door on your way out.

235
00:19:33,537 --> 00:19:34,960
Fine.

236
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:38,479
I'll tell Mom to save some for you,
in case you're hungry at night.

237
00:19:46,224 --> 00:19:48,822
Ran is 32 years old.

238
00:19:49,812 --> 00:19:51,723
I'm...

239
00:19:51,723 --> 00:19:53,119
13.

240
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:56,060
[Ran's age: 32]
[My age: 13]

241
00:19:56,060 --> 00:19:57,280
[Minus 9 months of pregnancy]

242
00:19:58,044 --> 00:19:59,377
That leaves...

243
00:20:00,690 --> 00:20:02,010
18.

244
00:20:12,010 --> 00:20:13,377
Ran?

245
00:20:22,131 --> 00:20:24,369
Yai already knows about Dao.

246
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:33,774
I can't deny it,
because he has the DNA test results.

247
00:20:35,954 --> 00:20:39,781
I'm scared he'll come to our house to ask you
and see Dao.

248
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:43,632
I don't want Dao to know

249
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:46,781
that I'm not her sister, but her mother.

250
00:20:48,552 --> 00:20:51,000
How did you talk to him?

251
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:54,320
I begged him not to tell Dao or anyone.

252
00:20:55,962 --> 00:20:57,280
Mom...

253
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:59,546
Yai told me he still loves me.

254
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,875
He wants us to go back to how things were.

255
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:06,474
But I can't do that. I'm scared.

256
00:21:12,945 --> 00:21:15,781
Oh? Are you full?

257
00:21:15,781 --> 00:21:17,440
I just realized

258
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,880
I have to go to my friend's house to study.

259
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,218
I'll be back tomorrow.

260
00:21:22,893 --> 00:21:23,915
Hey.

261
00:21:32,091 --> 00:21:34,843
It's okay, dear. It's okay.

262
00:21:37,117 --> 00:21:38,531
It'll be alright.

263
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:03,759
Ran doesn't want to hurt Dao's feelings

264
00:22:05,675 --> 00:22:07,260
if she found out...

265
00:22:10,659 --> 00:22:13,307
she was born to parents who weren't ready.

266
00:22:15,307 --> 00:22:18,940
Ran asked me not to reveal myself
as her father,

267
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,875
or she'll run away with Dao.

268
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:29,120
Grandma, did you know?

269
00:22:31,163 --> 00:22:33,346
She cut me out of her life.

270
00:22:36,730 --> 00:22:38,759
I still love her.

271
00:22:45,902 --> 00:22:47,988
Say it out loud. Okay?

272
00:22:47,988 --> 00:22:51,560
Being a man doesn't mean you can't cry.

273
00:22:55,219 --> 00:22:56,414
Grandma...

274
00:23:02,520 --> 00:23:04,932
I want my family back.

275
00:23:15,630 --> 00:23:16,828
Ran,

276
00:23:18,304 --> 00:23:20,851
can I sleep with you?

277
00:23:20,851 --> 00:23:22,579
Of course.

278
00:23:44,219 --> 00:23:45,777
What are you looking at?

279
00:23:47,228 --> 00:23:49,219
Have you ever had a boyfriend?

280
00:23:50,916 --> 00:23:52,172
I have.

281
00:23:53,251 --> 00:23:54,493
Why?

282
00:23:55,139 --> 00:23:56,600
And...

283
00:23:56,600 --> 00:23:58,227
How much did you love him?

284
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:00,569
Well...

285
00:24:01,698 --> 00:24:04,641
I loved him as much as a woman could.

286
00:24:05,395 --> 00:24:07,883
And where is he now?

287
00:24:13,609 --> 00:24:15,014
Go to sleep.

288
00:24:15,729 --> 00:24:17,936
You have class tomorrow.
Sleep now or you'll be late.

289
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:46,120
[Valentine's Day]

290
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:42,473
<i>Dao,</i>

291
00:25:42,473 --> 00:25:44,598
<i>you're tickling me.</i>

292
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:48,733
<i>Why does your tummy have stretch marks?</i>

293
00:25:48,733 --> 00:25:52,640
<i>Well, when you get pregnant,
your tummy gets bigger, right?</i>

294
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:54,960
<i>But after you give birth, it goes back down.</i>

295
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:57,332
<i>That's why I have these stretch marks.</i>

296
00:25:59,628 --> 00:26:02,199
<i>I'm her daughter.</i>

297
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,400
[MJTV Broadcasting]

298
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:54,692
<i>Sir, a man named Danai is here to see you.</i>

299
00:26:54,692 --> 00:26:56,067
Danai?

300
00:26:59,693 --> 00:27:01,688
Let him in.

301
00:27:01,688 --> 00:27:02,711
<i>Yes.</i>

302
00:27:04,739 --> 00:27:06,012
How are you?

303
00:27:06,698 --> 00:27:09,360
We didn't talk much the last time we met.

304
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:12,120
You've grown up quite a bit. How are you doing?

305
00:27:13,760 --> 00:27:14,760
Yeah.

306
00:27:15,656 --> 00:27:17,713
You do know

307
00:27:17,713 --> 00:27:19,848
that Dao isn't your mother's daughter, right?

308
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:23,301
I already knew about Dao.

309
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:27,309
Dao is my daughter with Ran.

310
00:27:27,309 --> 00:27:29,723
Ran actually doesn't want me to tell you,

311
00:27:31,517 --> 00:27:33,720
but I think you should know.

312
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,960
About what?

313
00:27:36,155 --> 00:27:38,360
Your mother threatened Ran

314
00:27:38,360 --> 00:27:39,926
that she had to break up with you

315
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:43,169
if she wants you to have a good future.

316
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,762
If Ran refused,

317
00:27:46,762 --> 00:27:49,560
she'd keep sending people to harass our family.

318
00:27:49,560 --> 00:27:51,680
Because she's rich,

319
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:54,160
she can hire anyone to hurt us.

320
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:56,428
Ran wanted to save two things,

321
00:27:56,428 --> 00:27:57,960
her daughter

322
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:59,919
and your future.

323
00:27:59,919 --> 00:28:01,466
That's why she did all of this.

324
00:28:02,120 --> 00:28:03,520
And did you know

325
00:28:04,261 --> 00:28:06,480
that Ran still loves you?

326
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:08,551
She never forgot you.

327
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:14,598
I just want my family to be happy.

328
00:28:14,598 --> 00:28:15,800
Right now,

329
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:18,808
I, Mom, and Dao

330
00:28:18,808 --> 00:28:21,926
have to watch Ran carry all this pain alone.

331
00:28:22,560 --> 00:28:26,966
It's been years since she divorced you.

332
00:28:28,076 --> 00:28:30,800
We're all about to become depressed,

333
00:28:30,800 --> 00:28:33,286
and Ran might already be.

334
00:28:33,992 --> 00:28:36,942
Ran shouldn't have to face all of this alone.

335
00:28:36,942 --> 00:28:38,420
While you were oblivious,

336
00:28:38,420 --> 00:28:41,044
- living happily in your ivory tow--
- I was never happy.

337
00:28:44,590 --> 00:28:46,450
I was never happy

338
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:50,935
ever since the day Ran broke up with me.

339
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:55,179
- If I had known all of this, I wouldn't have--
- Well, you know now!

340
00:28:55,179 --> 00:28:56,865
So do whatever you can

341
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,871
before it's too late.

342
00:29:12,276 --> 00:29:14,476
Should we move out?

343
00:29:14,476 --> 00:29:15,651
Why?

344
00:29:16,376 --> 00:29:17,800
Well...

345
00:29:17,800 --> 00:29:20,800
if Yai is still hanging around Dao like this,

346
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:22,760
his mother will eventually find out.

347
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:25,400
If Dao finds out about this,

348
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,253
I don't think I can take it.

349
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:32,520
Do you think running away from him
will fix the problem?

350
00:29:34,330 --> 00:29:35,640
Well...

351
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:38,155
If it would get us back to
the way we used to live

352
00:29:38,155 --> 00:29:40,480
before I met Yai,

353
00:29:40,480 --> 00:29:42,540
then the problem is solved.

354
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:47,612
It's my fault for deciding
to work so close to him,

355
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:50,514
because I actually...

356
00:29:53,464 --> 00:29:55,182
I shouldn't have done that.

357
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:03,042
Whatever you decide to do,
I'll go along with you.

358
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,917
Thank you, Mom.

359
00:30:07,861 --> 00:30:10,425
Oh, is Dao not up yet?

360
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,985
Didn't Dao go to sleep with you?

361
00:30:13,985 --> 00:30:15,360
What?

362
00:30:15,360 --> 00:30:17,667
I thought Dao went back to sleep with you.

363
00:30:17,667 --> 00:30:18,700
No!

364
00:30:34,240 --> 00:30:37,104
[Danai]

365
00:30:41,271 --> 00:30:42,779
Danai.

366
00:30:42,779 --> 00:30:45,468
Hello, is Mom home? Let me talk to her.

367
00:30:46,680 --> 00:30:48,595
I know everything now.

368
00:30:48,595 --> 00:30:49,695
About what?

369
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:52,459
That I'm the baby in Ran's belly,

370
00:30:52,459 --> 00:30:54,750
the one who gave her stretch marks,

371
00:30:54,750 --> 00:30:56,450
and ruined her future,

372
00:30:57,520 --> 00:30:59,552
keeping her from continuing her education.

373
00:31:00,747 --> 00:31:02,763
Dao, listen to me.

374
00:31:08,505 --> 00:31:09,571
Hello?

375
00:31:13,727 --> 00:31:14,982
She's not there?

376
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:22,065
[Ran]

377
00:31:25,133 --> 00:31:26,200
[Power off]

378
00:31:31,144 --> 00:31:33,354
How could I be a light?

379
00:31:33,354 --> 00:31:35,025
I'm just a pebble,

380
00:31:35,025 --> 00:31:38,308
more like a meteorite that
destroyed Ran's world.

381
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:44,708
Dao isn't at her tutoring school.

382
00:31:45,722 --> 00:31:47,807
I could reach her just now,
but she's turned off her phone.

383
00:31:47,807 --> 00:31:49,360
What happened?

384
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:51,720
I'll go look around in case
she's somewhere nearby.

385
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:54,360
Okay, okay. I'll call Danai then.

386
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,680
If anyone finds her,
please call me immediately.

387
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,844
Yes, yes.

388
00:32:02,048 --> 00:32:04,269
Why did you call Nana and me here?

389
00:32:05,760 --> 00:32:09,560
- I want to break off our engagement.
- Are you crazy?

390
00:32:09,560 --> 00:32:11,320
- Auntie.
- Not yet!

391
00:32:11,320 --> 00:32:13,058
I'll handle this.

392
00:32:13,890 --> 00:32:17,028
Are you not getting enough sleep,
or have you gone mad, huh?

393
00:32:17,028 --> 00:32:19,600
- I won't allow that!
- When you threatened Daran,

394
00:32:20,968 --> 00:32:24,104
telling her to get an abortion,
you didn't even ask me.

395
00:32:28,320 --> 00:32:29,742
Who told you that?

396
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:33,069
Was it Daran?

397
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,846
That brat!

398
00:32:38,354 --> 00:32:41,400
She showed her true colors
when she saw how far you'd come.

399
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:44,760
Do you see how awful she is? Do you?

400
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:46,160
I didn't hear it from Ran.

401
00:32:47,821 --> 00:32:50,258
Ran is a good wife and mother.

402
00:32:52,170 --> 00:32:53,312
Yai...

403
00:32:55,586 --> 00:32:57,691
Did you and Daran...

404
00:32:57,691 --> 00:32:59,766
have a kid together?

405
00:33:01,529 --> 00:33:02,595
Yes.

406
00:33:04,774 --> 00:33:06,720
But I didn't want her to get pregnant.

407
00:33:06,720 --> 00:33:10,440
Ran and I are the ones
who decide what happens in our family.

408
00:33:14,015 --> 00:33:17,560
Am I a stranger to you? I'm your mother!

409
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:20,145
I have the right to choose what's best for you

410
00:33:20,145 --> 00:33:24,200
and the right to get rid of any parasites
clinging to you!

411
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:26,563
Mom, that's my daughter and your granddaughter!

412
00:33:27,840 --> 00:33:29,880
She's your flesh and blood.

413
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:32,017
She's human,

414
00:33:32,783 --> 00:33:34,556
not a parasite.

415
00:33:35,368 --> 00:33:38,923
And you don't have the right to decide
who gets to live or die.

416
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:43,051
I've always listened to you,

417
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:46,791
but I can't allow you to hurt my family.

418
00:33:47,520 --> 00:33:49,635
What difference does it make?

419
00:33:50,880 --> 00:33:54,000
- Your family doesn't exist anymore!
- My daughter is still alive.

420
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:56,200
- Huh?
- Yai...

421
00:33:56,200 --> 00:33:58,160
Dao, Ran's younger sister,

422
00:33:58,160 --> 00:34:00,157
is our daughter.

423
00:34:04,498 --> 00:34:07,009
Ran isn't heartless like you.

424
00:34:08,278 --> 00:34:11,200
She chose to bear
all the pain to protect my future

425
00:34:11,200 --> 00:34:13,577
and let our child live.

426
00:34:13,577 --> 00:34:15,559
I've already wasted too much time.

427
00:34:16,285 --> 00:34:18,290
I'm taking my family back.

428
00:34:19,040 --> 00:34:20,266
Yai...

429
00:34:20,266 --> 00:34:22,931
And if you try to destroy my family again,

430
00:34:24,830 --> 00:34:26,681
I'll have to cut ties with you.

431
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:30,974
- Yai...
- I'm sorry, Nana.

432
00:34:34,087 --> 00:34:35,524
If you don't want to

433
00:34:37,680 --> 00:34:39,840
keep that ring, just throw it away.

434
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,000
Yai...

435
00:34:43,401 --> 00:34:45,440
- Yai...
- Yai...

436
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:46,568
Yai!

437
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:48,821
Yai!

438
00:34:59,297 --> 00:35:02,509
I'm sorry. I'll bring Yai back to you.

439
00:35:04,094 --> 00:35:05,354
How?

440
00:35:06,182 --> 00:35:08,446
How are you going to
take responsibility for this?

441
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:11,510
You humiliated me like this.

442
00:35:11,510 --> 00:35:13,800
How am I supposed to tell
my father and others

443
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:16,673
that my fiancé already has a wife and kid?

444
00:35:17,560 --> 00:35:20,735
- Can you give me some time to think?
- You don't have to think anymore!

445
00:35:22,560 --> 00:35:24,860
You tried to trick me.

446
00:35:24,860 --> 00:35:28,000
You cleaned up your son
and tried to pass him off to me.

447
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:30,079
Do you think I'm that stupid?

448
00:35:31,160 --> 00:35:33,080
Just wait and see.

449
00:35:33,080 --> 00:35:37,782
Your MJTV will pay for this!

450
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:50,842
Please don't turn this into
a bigger issue than it is.

451
00:35:52,803 --> 00:35:55,016
Didn't you tell me yourself

452
00:35:55,016 --> 00:35:57,560
that Daran has been with a lot of men?

453
00:35:58,218 --> 00:36:02,287
I didn't think that girl was Yai's daughter.
Believe me.

454
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:12,920
Nana... Listen to me!

455
00:36:22,690 --> 00:36:25,823
- Tai, have you seen Dao?
- No, I haven't seen her.

456
00:36:32,433 --> 00:36:36,370
- Uncle Rin, have you seen Dao?
- No.

457
00:36:36,370 --> 00:36:37,470
Thank you.

458
00:36:47,408 --> 00:36:49,649
Uncle Khai, have you seen Dao?

459
00:36:51,177 --> 00:36:52,360
Thank you.

460
00:37:03,511 --> 00:37:05,120
Maew,

461
00:37:05,120 --> 00:37:07,858
this is Ran, Dao's sister.

462
00:37:07,858 --> 00:37:09,772
Has Dao called you?

463
00:37:13,033 --> 00:37:16,019
If Dao calls you, can you tell me right away?

464
00:37:16,707 --> 00:37:17,822
Thanks.

465
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:33,884
Ran?

466
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:36,384
Please help me.

467
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:39,265
Dao is missing.

468
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:42,200
She ran away from home.

469
00:37:42,200 --> 00:37:44,040
Are you sure?

470
00:37:44,960 --> 00:37:46,360
<i>Please help me.</i>

471
00:37:47,754 --> 00:37:50,185
If you have the connections,

472
00:37:50,185 --> 00:37:51,745
please find our daughter.

473
00:37:52,480 --> 00:37:55,080
I don't know where else to look for her.

474
00:37:55,080 --> 00:37:58,368
Ran, calm down.
While you wait for me to get there,

475
00:37:58,368 --> 00:38:02,780
try to think...
think about what she said or asked you.

476
00:38:02,780 --> 00:38:04,265
<i>I'll contact the hospital</i>

477
00:38:04,265 --> 00:38:06,265
and the police for you.

478
00:38:07,283 --> 00:38:08,343
Yes.

479
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:30,552
Mom. Nobody has seen Dao.

480
00:38:32,848 --> 00:38:35,938
Dao knew that you were her mother.

481
00:38:37,200 --> 00:38:39,240
Danai is on his way back.

482
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:41,480
<i>An unidentified teenage girl</i>

483
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:44,463
<i>was found drowned beneath a bridge
over the Chao Phraya.</i>

484
00:38:44,463 --> 00:38:48,073
<i>The deceased remains unidentified,</i>

485
00:38:48,073 --> 00:38:51,426
<i>as police found no documents or evidence</i>

486
00:38:51,426 --> 00:38:53,400
<i>to help identify her.</i>

487
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:55,505
<i>The police have briefly informed us</i>

488
00:38:55,505 --> 00:38:58,430
<i>that the deceased was around 13-14 years old.</i>

489
00:38:58,430 --> 00:39:00,440
<i>We're now with a witness.</i>

490
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:02,000
Isn't that near our house?

491
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,600
<i>I was passing by and saw...</i>

492
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:04,760
Dao!

493
00:39:05,871 --> 00:39:06,917
Mom!

494
00:39:09,547 --> 00:39:10,755
Duean!

495
00:39:15,844 --> 00:39:17,224
Ran. Ran.

496
00:39:18,680 --> 00:39:19,966
Ran.

497
00:39:22,442 --> 00:39:23,857
Ran!

498
00:39:27,747 --> 00:39:29,720
I can't live...

499
00:39:29,720 --> 00:39:33,520
I can't live without Mom and Dao...

500
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:36,025
I can't live like this!
I can't take it anymore!

501
00:39:36,025 --> 00:39:38,518
Ran. Ran...

502
00:39:42,772 --> 00:39:43,836
Ran...

503
00:39:44,916 --> 00:39:47,080
I have to find my daughter.

504
00:39:47,080 --> 00:39:48,560
I have to find her!

505
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,400
- That might be Dao in the news.
- Ran!

506
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:54,040
Calm down. Don't panic. Calm down. Okay?

507
00:39:54,847 --> 00:39:55,920
- Let go.
- Ran.

508
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:58,240
- Please let me go, I have to find her.
- Ran.

509
00:39:58,240 --> 00:39:59,680
- I have to find her...
- Ran.

510
00:40:02,920 --> 00:40:05,310
It's okay. Your mother will be alright.

511
00:40:05,310 --> 00:40:07,240
She will be alright.

512
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:09,544
She is going to be alright.

513
00:40:14,080 --> 00:40:15,318
It's okay...

514
00:40:17,005 --> 00:40:18,355
It's okay.

515
00:40:19,191 --> 00:40:21,177
Your mother is going to be alright.

516
00:40:24,682 --> 00:40:26,482
- Can I help?
- Oh, sure.

517
00:41:15,819 --> 00:41:17,866
Your mother is safe.

518
00:41:19,741 --> 00:41:21,533
I'm going to find my daughter.

519
00:41:21,533 --> 00:41:23,120
Dao is also safe.

520
00:41:26,056 --> 00:41:27,756
Have you found her?

521
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,480
[Lek]

522
00:41:35,066 --> 00:41:36,350
<i>Yeah?</i>

523
00:41:36,350 --> 00:41:37,800
<i>Where are you right now?</i>

524
00:41:42,600 --> 00:41:44,766
Dao came to my house looking for me.

525
00:41:46,537 --> 00:41:49,327
Dao wanted to know if she was our daughter.

526
00:41:50,018 --> 00:41:52,170
Why did she want to know?

527
00:41:52,920 --> 00:41:56,733
I didn't tell her anything.
She probably overheard something.

528
00:41:58,960 --> 00:42:01,545
Can you drive her here?
Don't let her stay over there.

529
00:42:01,545 --> 00:42:03,140
Don't worry, Ran.

530
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,795
I knew everything.

531
00:42:08,600 --> 00:42:11,139
About what my mother did to you,

532
00:42:14,737 --> 00:42:17,147
and why you asked for a divorce.

533
00:42:25,843 --> 00:42:28,311
From now on, you don't have to be scared.

534
00:42:30,492 --> 00:42:33,836
I won't let anyone separate us anymore.

535
00:42:33,836 --> 00:42:35,803
Even if it's my mother...

536
00:42:39,412 --> 00:42:41,300
I'll protect my family.

537
00:42:42,600 --> 00:42:43,970
Don't cry.

538
00:42:57,000 --> 00:43:02,153
Yai still kept everything out of love

539
00:43:02,153 --> 00:43:04,363
and for the memories.

540
00:43:05,932 --> 00:43:08,319
Ran told me that...

541
00:43:08,319 --> 00:43:10,240
she still loves Uncle Yai.

542
00:43:10,240 --> 00:43:13,600
Yai still loves Daran just the same.

543
00:43:16,522 --> 00:43:20,677
I put Ran and Uncle Yai through a lot.

544
00:43:21,530 --> 00:43:23,418
Ran is smart,

545
00:43:23,418 --> 00:43:26,074
and she was about to make the national team.

546
00:43:27,040 --> 00:43:29,280
Uncle Yai must have felt miserable

547
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:33,231
when Ran lied and broke up with him.

548
00:43:34,429 --> 00:43:36,012
If I hadn't been born...

549
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:41,200
Don't blame yourself, dear.
Don't blame yourself.

550
00:43:41,200 --> 00:43:45,320
You were born out of their love.

551
00:43:45,320 --> 00:43:48,937
Your mother really loves you.

552
00:43:48,937 --> 00:43:52,080
That's why she kept you

553
00:43:52,080 --> 00:43:55,280
and tried to raise you as best as she could.

554
00:43:56,400 --> 00:43:58,640
The past is a lesson,

555
00:43:58,640 --> 00:44:02,023
not something to use to judge
someone in the present, Dao.

556
00:44:03,626 --> 00:44:05,046
Right.

557
00:44:07,147 --> 00:44:10,914
Ran took care of me like a mother,

558
00:44:12,125 --> 00:44:14,578
and she actually is.

559
00:44:16,245 --> 00:44:17,984
Then go live with your mother

560
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:21,520
and never come back here.

561
00:44:21,520 --> 00:44:24,320
I'll never accept you, just like your mother!

562
00:44:24,320 --> 00:44:26,177
- Get out!
- Ow! Let go!

563
00:44:26,177 --> 00:44:27,400
Stop this, Angkhana.

564
00:44:31,200 --> 00:44:32,600
You!

565
00:44:32,600 --> 00:44:34,177
- Auntie! Auntie!
- Ow! Stop!

566
00:44:34,880 --> 00:44:36,013
Let her go, Auntie.

567
00:44:36,960 --> 00:44:38,240
You brat!

568
00:44:39,222 --> 00:44:40,402
That's enough!

569
00:44:42,360 --> 00:44:46,027
You goddamn brat! I'll hit you until you bleed!

570
00:44:59,760 --> 00:45:02,247
Don't you want to see your child happy?

571
00:45:02,247 --> 00:45:04,200
Why are you so selfish?

572
00:45:04,200 --> 00:45:10,186
Don't get me started on how someone like you
doesn't deserve to be a mother!

573
00:45:10,186 --> 00:45:11,400
Sure.

574
00:45:12,560 --> 00:45:14,169
Someone who's not right

575
00:45:14,169 --> 00:45:16,125
never does anything right in your eyes!

576
00:45:16,125 --> 00:45:17,765
In your eyes, at least!

577
00:45:18,840 --> 00:45:21,715
You came to your own conclusion

578
00:45:21,715 --> 00:45:23,760
about what type of person I was.

579
00:45:23,760 --> 00:45:25,600
I'm not cruel,

580
00:45:25,600 --> 00:45:28,160
refusing to hear, see, speak,

581
00:45:28,160 --> 00:45:31,490
or care about anything
but myself like you are!

582
00:45:31,490 --> 00:45:32,880
Mom!

583
00:45:32,880 --> 00:45:35,400
Oh, I forgot

584
00:45:35,400 --> 00:45:37,957
that you can't teach old dogs new tricks.

585
00:45:38,872 --> 00:45:40,440
I'll let you choose.

586
00:45:40,440 --> 00:45:43,387
If you still want to stay here,

587
00:45:43,387 --> 00:45:47,680
you can either change
and earn your juniors' respect,

588
00:45:47,680 --> 00:45:49,231
or get out!

589
00:45:50,576 --> 00:45:52,840
- Mom, you're kicking me out?
- I am!

590
00:45:52,840 --> 00:45:55,379
Yai, do not get mad at me.

591
00:45:55,379 --> 00:45:57,240
I have to take care of this.

592
00:45:57,240 --> 00:46:00,000
I need to deal with it at the source.

593
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:01,320
Alright, Grandma.

594
00:46:01,320 --> 00:46:02,280
Yai!

595
00:46:02,280 --> 00:46:04,320
Please watch your language, Auntie.

596
00:46:04,320 --> 00:46:06,325
Don't tarnish my family's reputation.

597
00:46:06,910 --> 00:46:09,000
What do you say? Huh?

598
00:46:09,000 --> 00:46:11,918
Are you going to get out or change yourself?

599
00:46:22,659 --> 00:46:24,299
I will try.

600
00:46:38,078 --> 00:46:40,523
Uncle Yai, why did you leave Ran?

601
00:46:41,371 --> 00:46:42,890
Do you know

602
00:46:43,529 --> 00:46:46,132
how much she loved you?

603
00:46:47,172 --> 00:46:48,851
It was stupid of me

604
00:46:49,522 --> 00:46:51,117
not to see it all.

605
00:46:53,282 --> 00:46:54,898
I won't ask

606
00:46:55,766 --> 00:46:58,212
why you left Ran.

607
00:46:58,212 --> 00:47:01,840
But did you know she was pregnant?

608
00:47:05,162 --> 00:47:06,559
I did.

609
00:47:13,385 --> 00:47:14,682
So didn't you...

610
00:47:15,467 --> 00:47:16,494
love...

611
00:47:19,307 --> 00:47:21,346
the baby in her belly?

612
00:47:23,160 --> 00:47:24,288
Yes,

613
00:47:25,906 --> 00:47:27,104
I do.

614
00:47:28,475 --> 00:47:30,236
I love her so much.

615
00:47:33,520 --> 00:47:36,002
So why did you leave her?

616
00:47:36,002 --> 00:47:38,361
Why didn't you stay with her?

617
00:47:41,160 --> 00:47:42,446
I'm sorry.

618
00:47:44,240 --> 00:47:49,087
I won't leave you ever again, Dao.
I'm right here, Dao.

619
00:47:49,735 --> 00:47:51,945
I want my dad.

620
00:47:51,945 --> 00:47:53,960
I'm right here.

621
00:47:53,960 --> 00:47:56,017
Dad is right here, sweetheart.

622
00:47:57,520 --> 00:48:00,360
Don't disappear on me again.

623
00:48:00,360 --> 00:48:02,571
I won't ever do that again.

624
00:48:02,571 --> 00:48:04,196
Don't be scared.

625
00:48:09,749 --> 00:48:11,571
I love you, sweetheart.

626
00:48:17,556 --> 00:48:20,022
Don't cry. I'm right here.

627
00:48:30,626 --> 00:48:31,852
Dao.

628
00:48:41,228 --> 00:48:44,282
Dao, what happened? Who did this to you?

629
00:48:44,906 --> 00:48:47,244
It's just some scratches.

630
00:48:47,244 --> 00:48:49,274
It doesn't hurt at all.

631
00:49:02,720 --> 00:49:05,142
I used to wonder

632
00:49:05,142 --> 00:49:07,766
where the feelings of warmth

633
00:49:07,766 --> 00:49:09,800
and safety

634
00:49:09,800 --> 00:49:12,962
that I felt when I was younger were from.

635
00:49:13,640 --> 00:49:15,560
Now, I realize

636
00:49:17,080 --> 00:49:19,572
that they were from you.

637
00:49:23,883 --> 00:49:26,485
I'm sorry I worried you.

638
00:49:27,480 --> 00:49:29,425
I just wanted...

639
00:49:29,425 --> 00:49:32,003
to return your love.

640
00:49:49,760 --> 00:49:51,790
Does your foot hurt?

641
00:49:58,440 --> 00:50:01,575
I don't know what they'd think

642
00:50:02,331 --> 00:50:04,803
if they found out
they were their sister's children.

643
00:50:05,694 --> 00:50:07,240
But to me,

644
00:50:08,740 --> 00:50:10,780
it feels so special,

645
00:50:12,011 --> 00:50:14,311
even more special than anyone could imagine,

646
00:50:15,507 --> 00:50:17,632
to have...

647
00:50:19,843 --> 00:50:21,530
a mother like you.

648
00:50:26,463 --> 00:50:28,960
To cherish something

649
00:50:29,642 --> 00:50:32,810
that you love as best as you can,

650
00:50:33,773 --> 00:50:36,218
if you had to sacrifice it all

651
00:50:37,297 --> 00:50:39,921
and leave everything on earth behind

652
00:50:41,080 --> 00:50:44,202
just so you could cherish what you love,

653
00:50:45,720 --> 00:50:47,507
you would.

654
00:50:49,720 --> 00:50:53,007
I still remember what you used to say.

655
00:50:57,600 --> 00:50:59,270
Thank you,

656
00:51:00,480 --> 00:51:01,887
Mom.

657
00:51:05,573 --> 00:51:07,475
My baby...

658
00:51:38,480 --> 00:51:42,080
Let's go see Mom.
Ooh, I have to call her "Granny" now.

659
00:51:42,080 --> 00:51:44,556
No, I'll call her Mom like before.

660
00:51:45,280 --> 00:51:48,065
Right now, I have both my dad and mom.

661
00:51:48,065 --> 00:51:50,585
It's just a matter of when they'll make up.

662
00:51:52,879 --> 00:51:55,227
It'll be the same as it was.

663
00:51:55,227 --> 00:51:57,440
If he wants to see you,

664
00:51:57,440 --> 00:51:59,017
we'll let him visit.

665
00:52:01,400 --> 00:52:02,986
Come on.

666
00:52:05,800 --> 00:52:08,320
My ex-partner's new partner is jealous

667
00:52:08,320 --> 00:52:10,280
because my ex-partner's finger slipped

668
00:52:10,280 --> 00:52:12,838
and sent a message to the wrong chat room!

669
00:52:12,838 --> 00:52:14,560
What are you saying? I can't make sense of it.

670
00:52:14,560 --> 00:52:16,400
Jeez, Mom!

671
00:52:16,400 --> 00:52:17,640
- Dao...
- Mom.

672
00:52:17,640 --> 00:52:18,640
Ran.

673
00:52:23,400 --> 00:52:25,933
You've found out about everything, right?

674
00:52:25,933 --> 00:52:27,777
Yes, I have.

675
00:52:28,378 --> 00:52:30,680
And you're not angry at your mom?

676
00:52:30,680 --> 00:52:32,603
She did it

677
00:52:32,603 --> 00:52:35,080
because she wanted
to protect your feelings, dear.

678
00:52:35,840 --> 00:52:37,619
I'm not angry,

679
00:52:37,619 --> 00:52:39,600
but I'm about to be.

680
00:52:39,600 --> 00:52:41,364
What? Why the heck is that?

681
00:52:42,064 --> 00:52:44,478
Ran refuses to make up with Uncle Yai.

682
00:52:45,475 --> 00:52:47,574
It's for the best.

683
00:52:47,574 --> 00:52:49,205
I'm not a great match for him.

684
00:53:19,080 --> 00:53:21,150
We finally meet.

685
00:53:21,783 --> 00:53:23,680
May your virtues protect you.

686
00:53:23,680 --> 00:53:25,529
Thank you, Mom.

687
00:53:26,840 --> 00:53:28,680
Let me make some calls.

688
00:53:28,680 --> 00:53:31,474
I didn't tell anyone at work
why I disappeared.

689
00:53:40,170 --> 00:53:41,920
Keep at it, brother.

690
00:53:41,920 --> 00:53:44,120
I'll help you, Uncle Yai.

691
00:53:52,080 --> 00:53:53,716
What the heck, Dao?

692
00:53:53,716 --> 00:53:56,000
From now on, I'll spend the nights with Ran.

693
00:53:56,000 --> 00:53:58,120
Go sleep in Mom's room.

694
00:53:58,120 --> 00:53:59,480
I'm not used to it!

695
00:54:01,640 --> 00:54:04,529
Depriving a daughter of her mom is cruel.

696
00:54:05,680 --> 00:54:07,115
You rascal!

697
00:54:08,440 --> 00:54:09,810
I'm leaving.

698
00:54:18,782 --> 00:54:20,480
Oh?

699
00:54:20,480 --> 00:54:21,800
What's this?

700
00:54:21,800 --> 00:54:24,396
You already chased him away,
so why lie down here?

701
00:54:25,520 --> 00:54:29,084
I'm sleeping here for tonight.
I need some warmth.

702
00:54:31,548 --> 00:54:32,935
Ran?

703
00:54:34,977 --> 00:54:36,680
Mom.

704
00:54:36,680 --> 00:54:38,560
I'm not used to it.

705
00:54:40,840 --> 00:54:43,280
You can call me "Ran" or "Mommy."

706
00:54:43,280 --> 00:54:45,310
Whatever you want, I don't mind.

707
00:54:46,200 --> 00:54:47,640
Then...

708
00:54:47,640 --> 00:54:49,982
once you make up with Yai,

709
00:54:49,982 --> 00:54:52,459
I'll call you two Dad and Mom.

710
00:54:54,400 --> 00:54:57,240
Go to sleep, or you'll wake up late.

711
00:54:58,080 --> 00:54:59,354
I'm turning off the light.

712
00:55:12,445 --> 00:55:15,400
[Special little Star]
<i>Uncle Yai, are you still at work?</i>

713
00:55:15,400 --> 00:55:17,408
<i>Great-grandma said</i>

714
00:55:17,408 --> 00:55:21,280
<i>you've been working so hard lately.</i>

715
00:55:21,280 --> 00:55:23,930
[Ran's Uncle Yai]
<i>It's pretty rough. I'm still in a meeting.</i>

716
00:55:23,930 --> 00:55:26,280
<i>This place is full of nagging old farts.</i>

717
00:55:26,280 --> 00:55:29,320
[Special little Star]
<i>Whoa, but this is already 10 P.M.</i>

718
00:55:29,320 --> 00:55:31,040
<i>Take a break, Uncle Yai.</i>

719
00:55:31,040 --> 00:55:34,145
<i>I don't want to be prematurely orphaned.</i>

720
00:55:34,145 --> 00:55:37,242
<i>Secretly texting in a meeting room
is already a break for my brain.</i>

721
00:55:42,102 --> 00:55:43,970
Where were we?

722
00:55:43,970 --> 00:55:46,778
We're discussing the project timeline.

723
00:55:46,778 --> 00:55:48,320
Right...

724
00:55:48,320 --> 00:55:51,039
Could you recap it for me again?

725
00:55:56,074 --> 00:55:57,705
Dao.

726
00:55:57,705 --> 00:56:00,797
How are you going to breathe
with a blanket over your head?

727
00:56:03,874 --> 00:56:06,633
Why won't you be nice to Uncle Yai for once?

728
00:56:10,040 --> 00:56:12,520
Because he already has a fiancée.

729
00:56:12,520 --> 00:56:14,667
He's called off the engagement, though.

730
00:56:14,667 --> 00:56:17,680
With his status and career,

731
00:56:17,680 --> 00:56:19,800
he'll find someone new eventually.

732
00:56:19,800 --> 00:56:21,760
But he loves you.

733
00:56:21,760 --> 00:56:24,752
Let him go find someone better than me.

734
00:56:24,752 --> 00:56:28,240
You're nice to absolutely everyone on earth,
except yourself.

735
00:56:28,240 --> 00:56:29,791
I'm sulky!

736
00:56:38,800 --> 00:56:40,377
Go to sleep.

737
00:56:50,539 --> 00:56:52,944
Ms. Natasha, how may I be of help?

738
00:57:07,629 --> 00:57:09,720
<i>- Your niece?
- My daughter!</i>

739
00:57:09,720 --> 00:57:12,160
<i>Everything on my schedule is canceled.</i>

740
00:57:12,160 --> 00:57:14,832
<i>I don't think I can keep hiring you anymore.</i>

741
00:57:14,832 --> 00:57:17,480
<i>This is the face of a woman and a baby</i>

742
00:57:17,480 --> 00:57:19,600
<i>whom Yai has kept hidden for a decade.</i>

743
00:57:19,600 --> 00:57:20,680
<i>The sponsors have all pulled out?</i>

744
00:57:20,680 --> 00:57:23,000
<i>Ms. Nana can't destroy Ran like that.</i>

745
00:57:23,000 --> 00:57:25,560
<i>How are you going to
talk your way out of it now, Yai?</i>

746
00:57:25,560 --> 00:57:28,760
<i>Is it true that you became
engaged to Ms. Natasha,</i>

747
00:57:28,760 --> 00:57:30,584
<i>even though you have a family of your own?</i>

748
00:57:30,584 --> 00:57:31,520
<i>It's true.</i>

749
00:57:31,520 --> 00:57:35,665
<i>What do I have to do for you to
give me a chance to be your husband?</i>
